    <briefdescription>
<para>4x4 matrix class for 3D transformations and projections. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The matrix is stored in column-major order (OpenGL style), meaning the data array is organized as:</para>
<para>[ col0, col1, col2, col3 ]</para>
<para>where each column is a Vector4.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All static methods return a new <ref refid="classMatrix4" kindref="compound">Matrix4</ref> instance. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structVector3D" kindref="compound">Vector3D</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
